{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-3wvj-j6qm-62mr","cve_id":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/envoyproxy/envoy/security-advisories/GHSA-3wvj-j6qm-62mr","html_url":"https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/security/advisories/GHSA-3wvj-j6qm-62mr","summary":"Out-of-Bounds Write in Brotli Decompressor","description":"### Summary\r\n\r\nEnvoy versions v1.39.2, v1.38.5, v1.37.7 and v1.36.11 are vulnerable to a buffer overflow vulnerability in the Brotli decoder.\r\n\r\n### Details\r\n\r\nA buffer overflow vulnerability in the Brotli decompressor in Envoy v1.39.2, v1.38.5, v1.37.7 and v1.36.11 on all platforms allows a remote unauthenticated attacker to corrupt adjacent decoder state memory, disclose sensitive memory contents, cause a denial of service, or potentially execute arbitrary code using a crafted Brotli-compressed stream. This vulnerability was addressed in Envoy v1.40.0, v1.39.3, v1.38.6, v1.37.8 and v1.36.12.\r\n\r\nBrotli vulnerability was published under [CVE-2026-111497](https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-111497)\r\n\r\n### Impact\r\n\r\nEnvoy deployments that have Brotli decompressor configured.\r\n\r\n### Credits\r\n\r\nOpenAI Security Research - outbounddisclosures@openai.com","severity":"critical","author":null,"publisher":{"login":"yanavlasov","id":6360027,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNjAwMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6360027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov","html_url":"https://github.com/yanavlasov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanavlasov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-3wvj-j6qm-62mr","type":"GHSA"}],"state":"published","created_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:03:27Z","published_at":"2026-10-23T16:03:27Z","closed_at":null,"withdrawn_at":null,"submission":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"envoy proxy","name":"Envoy"},"vulnerable_version_range":"v1.39.2, v1.38.5, v1.37.7, v1.36.11","patched_versions":"v1.40.0, v1.39.3, v1.38.6, v1.37.8, v1.36.12","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":null,"score":null},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N","score":9.2}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-252","name":"Unchecked Return Value"},{"cwe_id":"CWE-787","name":"Out-of-bounds Write"}],"cwe_ids":["CWE-252","CWE-787"],"credits":[],"credits_detailed":[],"collaborating_users":null,"collaborating_teams":null,"private_fork":null,"comments":0,"cvss":{"vector_string":null,"score":null}}